@startuml coupon-operator-stats-activity
title 查看与统计优惠券

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "PingFang SC, Microsoft YaHei, sans-serif"
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #94A3B8
  DiamondBackgroundColor #F0F9FF
  DiamondBorderColor #3B82F6
  StartColor #16A34A
  EndColor #EF4444
  ArrowColor #475569
}
skinparam swimlane {
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  BorderColor #CBD5E1
  TitleBackgroundColor #E2E8F0
}

|运营|

start

